  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "gym_kusa_010_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "C20C959C9FC7CFAF",
      "text": "歡迎光臨深缽道館！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_kusa_010_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "C20C969C9FC7D162",
      "text": "請讓我登記\\n挑戰者的名字……\\r\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳是[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，對吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_kusa_010_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "C20C979C9FC7D315",
      "text": "想和本道館的館主寇沙對戰，\\n就必須先通過道館測驗。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_kusa_010_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "C20C909C9FC7C730",
      "text": "深缽道館的道館測驗是……\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]收集向日花怪[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_kusa_010_receptionist_history",
      "hash64": "A60C21835437EBCC",
      "text": "深缽鎮是藝術之鎮……\\c\\n人們對能夠激起作品靈感的「大自然」，\\n以及孕育大自然的「太陽」滿懷感恩。\\c\\n因此，這裡有著去收集兼具這些要素的\\n向日花怪並且款待牠們的風俗習慣。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_kusa_010_receptionist_05",
      "hash64": "C20C919C9FC7C8E3",
      "text": "我們希望[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳能在深缽鎮\\n找出像太陽又像花兒的寶可夢，\\r\\n也就是向日花怪。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_kusa_010_receptionist_06",
      "hash64": "C20C929C9FC7CA96",
      "text": "集滿[VAR 0x0201(0001)]隻，\\n並且將牠們帶到向日花怪廣場，\\r\\n就算通過道館測驗了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_kusa_010_receptionist_map",
      "hash64": "830B93225E20E9E2",
      "text": "首先我會幫[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳將向日花怪廣場的位置\\n登錄到地圖上。\\c\\n細節就請[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳去問\\n在那裡的工作人員吧。\\c\\n走出道館後立刻右轉！\\n往很大的向日花怪裝飾走就對了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
